  "about": "The V2 transaction envelope (tx_expiry gate): a user transaction that signs its last height. For each kind the JSON body, the signed text under a fixed network id, the canonical bytes the hash covers, the hash and the binary wire form; one V1 transfer beside them. Checked by the node (development/qnet-integration/src/node/mod.rs, tx_v2_vectors) and by the wallets that sign V2.",
